    "body": "Great catch.\r\n\r\nI think what we should actually do is restore [that section](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#wai-aria) to the dev edition, but modified. We should w-nodev the first sentence about user agent requirements, and rephrase the second sentence to talk about authoring requirements for web developers instead of requirements on conformance checkers, or maybe talk about both.\r\n\r\nAlternately we could w-nodev the sentence you point out and, in the dev edition, replace it with a different one that directly references [ARIAHTML]. Maybe that would be cleaner.",
